<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2090369504"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1798370847"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Apocalypse"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RAISE A SUILEN"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Apocalypse"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:12.600"><div begin="00:04.216" end="04:02.355"><p begin="00:04.216" end="00:07.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">「Thanks, for it is our pains that form the base<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">万分感谢 因为我们的痛苦奠定了基础</span></p><p begin="00:08.365" end="00:10.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">As the Apocalypse is spoken<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正如天启所言</span></p><p begin="00:11.209" end="00:14.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">The next stage shall shine brightly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下一阶段应该会大放异彩</span></p><p begin="00:14.418" end="00:16.645" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">So now... "Break it down."」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以现在就摧毁一切</span></p><p begin="00:29.656" end="00:32.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">現実に食い散らかされた理想郷<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被现实吞没的乌托邦</span></p><p begin="00:32.779" end="00:35.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">血縁の愛憎 ブルーライトと踊る激情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">血缘的爱憎</span></p><p begin="00:35.920" end="00:39.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ドレスコードMy head phone, Trackに埋葬<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把着装要求埋葬进我的耳机里</span></p><p begin="00:39.358" end="00:42.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">RAISE, RAISE, ブッ壊してWe gonna show<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上升 上升 大肆破坏 我们要大显身手</span></p><p begin="00:48.628" end="00:50.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Break it down, Break it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切 挣脱束缚</span></p><p begin="00:50.833" end="00:54.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">We ain't gonna wait, we ain't gonna bow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们迫不及待 我们绝不屈服</span></p><p begin="00:54.591" end="00:58.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Pull the trigger and go いつだってそうだろ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扣动扳机 倾泻火力 无论何时都是如此吧</span></p><p begin="00:58.175" end="01:00.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Do it now, Do it now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">立刻付诸行动 立刻付诸行动</span></p><p begin="01:00.798" end="01:02.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Our Voice, Our Rhythm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的声音 我们的韵律</span></p><p begin="01:02.216" end="01:04.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Our Art, Our Might, Day and night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的艺术 我们的力量 不舍昼夜</span></p><p begin="01:04.727" end="01:08.195" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">諦め悪さでRing the gong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不死心地敲响锣鼓</span></p><p begin="01:08.247" end="01:11.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">We are bringing the fire, the passion so bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们带来花火 让激情肆意燃烧</span></p><p begin="01:11.095" end="01:13.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">名前を呼んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼唤姓名</span></p><p begin="01:13.328" end="01:16.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Changing the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变世界</span></p><p begin="01:16.611" end="01:19.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Together we rise, united we stand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们共同崛起 我们团结一致</span></p><p begin="01:19.748" end="01:23.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Changing the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变世界</span></p><p begin="01:23.207" end="01:24.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">New World, New Sound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">新世界 新声音</span></p><p begin="01:24.759" end="01:27.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">We are breaking barriers all around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们摧毁横亘在周围的障碍</span></p><p begin="01:27.093" end="01:28.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">So come on, join the ride<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 加入这趟旅程</span></p><p begin="01:30.283" end="01:33.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="01:33.473" end="01:36.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="01:35.259" end="01:36.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Break it, Break it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切</span></p><p begin="01:36.667" end="01:39.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">DA DA DA DA DA</span></p><p begin="01:39.865" end="01:43.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="01:42.442" end="01:43.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Shout out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声呐喊</span></p><p begin="01:55.879" end="01:59.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Jerky片手に 今日もMusic Junkie<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一手拿着熏肉条 今天也为音乐痴狂</span></p><p begin="01:59.141" end="02:02.325" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">ツマラナイ ツマラナイ ClickでArrange<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好无聊 好无聊 用点击来重新安排</span></p><p begin="02:02.325" end="02:05.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Complexと劣等感の殴り合いでRevenge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用复杂与自卑感的互相冲突来复仇</span></p><p begin="02:05.462" end="02:08.645" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">(RAISE)RAISE, (RAISE)RAISE, 日々Version up遺伝子<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上升 上升 每天基因都在更新</span></p><p begin="02:14.977" end="02:17.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Break it down, Break it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切 挣脱束缚</span></p><p begin="02:17.262" end="02:20.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">拡声器で殴り込んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从扩音器里发起攻击</span></p><p begin="02:20.982" end="02:24.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">全てを蹴り上げ 野心を積み上げた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踢开一切 不断积累野心</span></p><p begin="02:24.578" end="02:27.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">夜明け前へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去往黎明前</span></p><p begin="02:36.089" end="02:37.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Break it down, Break it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切</span></p><p begin="02:37.416" end="02:39.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Our music's the Shotgun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的音乐就是武器</span></p><p begin="02:39.297" end="02:40.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Break it down, Break it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切 挣脱束缚</span></p><p begin="02:40.869" end="02:42.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Gila, Killer, Killer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化身成为杀手</span></p><p begin="02:42.566" end="02:43.797" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Break it down, Break it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切</span></p><p begin="02:43.807" end="02:45.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Our music's the Shotgun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的音乐就是武器</span></p><p begin="02:45.692" end="02:47.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Break it down, Break it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切 挣脱束缚</span></p><p begin="02:47.455" end="02:51.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Break it down, Break it down...<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的痛苦 我们的愤怒</span></p><p begin="03:07.180" end="03:08.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Our Pain, Our Anger<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的痛苦 我们的愤怒</span></p><p begin="03:08.639" end="03:11.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Our Sorrow, Our Hatred, You and I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的悲伤 我们的仇恨 你与我</span></p><p begin="03:11.135" end="03:14.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Destroying the trash, making a blast<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁废物 引发轰动</span></p><p begin="03:14.565" end="03:17.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">We're taking over, standing our ground<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们主宰一切 坚守立场</span></p><p begin="03:17.624" end="03:19.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">創造主と成れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为创造的主吧</span></p><p begin="03:19.767" end="03:22.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Changing the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变世界</span></p><p begin="03:23.012" end="03:26.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">You know that nothing can stop us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我们势不可挡</span></p><p begin="03:26.112" end="03:29.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">Changing the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变世界</span></p><p begin="03:29.656" end="03:31.165" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">New World, New Sound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">新世界 新声音</span></p><p begin="03:31.175" end="03:33.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">We are breaking barriers all around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们摧毁横亘在周围的障碍</span></p><p begin="03:33.458" end="03:35.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">So come on, join the ride<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 加入这趟旅程</span></p><p begin="03:36.638" end="03:39.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="03:39.812" end="03:43.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="03:41.599" end="03:43.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">Break it, Break it down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁一切</span></p><p begin="03:43.039" end="03:46.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">DA DA DA DA DA</span></p><p begin="03:46.262" end="03:49.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="03:48.790" end="03:49.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">Shout out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声呐喊</span></p><p begin="03:49.541" end="03:52.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">DA DA DA DA DA</span></p><p begin="03:52.669" end="03:55.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">DA DA DA DA DA</span></p><p begin="03:55.891" end="03:59.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p><p begin="03:59.078" end="04:02.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA DA</p></div></body></tt>